{
  "id": "dialogue.hiori.answer",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "かつて夢見た眩しい姿",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hiori.answer",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hiori.answer",
    "idolId": "hiori",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……？好，我知道了。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "接下来……兴趣是听音乐，特长是做饭……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "下面是……嗯……啊，这个问题是……",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯？怎么了？有不想回答的问题吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "不……不是那样。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我看看……「成为偶像的契机」？说起来，我也没详细听过。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "那不是什么大不了的事。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过我有兴趣。能说给我听吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……中学的时候，学园祭上有偶像来过。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "舞台上的偶像闪闪发光，看着的人都在笑……",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "我想，如果能变成那样，连我自己都会喜欢上自己吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……这就是灯织的契机啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……不过，总觉得有点不可思议。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？为什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "这么点事，不久之前我应该还说不出口。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那正说明，这件事对灯织来说很重要。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "也许……是这样。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那么，现在的你喜欢上了什么呢——",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……不，这个答案，等你站上那个舞台之后再告诉我吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……好，我知道了。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "灯织，接下来的舞台……",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "不留遗憾",
            "nextNodeId": "2-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "一定要赢",
            "nextNodeId": "3-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "expression",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "按你的想法来",
            "nextNodeId": "4-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "sharedStat",
                "stat": "stress",
                "delta": -2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "灯织，采访辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "制作人才辛苦。",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我只是在一旁看着你好好说话而已。",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "对了……杂志的事前问卷也寄来了。稍微休息一下再写可以吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "不用，浪费时间，我现在就写。",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊。那填在这里，我去调整一下日程。",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "谢谢。那个……",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "「重要的东西」……可以写\"制作人送的发饰\"吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，嗯。写是可以……不过，请只写\"镶诞生石的发饰\"。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "2-01": {
        "id": "2-01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不留遗憾地去。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-02"
      },
      "2-02": {
        "id": "2-02",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "好，我会全力以赴。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-03"
      },
      "2-03": {
        "id": "2-03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "就是这股气势！",
        "nextNodeId": "2-04"
      },
      "2-04": {
        "id": "2-04",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "好。……那个，制作人，我今天本来打算马上回去的……",
        "nextNodeId": "2-05"
      },
      "2-05": {
        "id": "2-05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "要练课吧？我就知道，已经排好了。"
      },
      "3-01": {
        "id": "3-01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "一定要赢。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-02"
      },
      "3-02": {
        "id": "3-02",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "好，我不想输。会把积累的东西全都使出来。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-03"
      },
      "3-03": {
        "id": "3-03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。你的努力我最清楚，所以一定没问题。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-04"
      },
      "3-04": {
        "id": "3-04",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "被制作人这么说，就真的会那样觉得，真不可思议。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-05"
      },
      "3-05": {
        "id": "3-05",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……请看到最后。"
      },
      "4-01": {
        "id": "4-01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "按你的想法去做。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-02"
      },
      "4-02": {
        "id": "4-02",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "是让我自由发挥的意思吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "4-03"
      },
      "4-03": {
        "id": "4-03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。这次的舞台对灯织来说，一定会成为难忘的东西。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-04"
      },
      "4-04": {
        "id": "4-04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以不用套模板，按你想的去做就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-05"
      },
      "4-05": {
        "id": "4-05",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……好，我明白了！"
      }
    }
  },
